Package: sandfly-processdecloak
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Built-Using: ${misc:Built-Using}
Description: Find hidden processes on the local Linux system
 sandfly-processdecloak finds processes that loadable kernel module stealth
 rootkits hide on Linux. This package builds it from the upstream Go source,
 replacing the earlier package that shipped a prebuilt x86-64 binary.
